{
  "name": "Imbuing Touch",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As an Action, you can touch one nonmagical weapon and spend 2 sorcery points to imbue it with magic for 1 minute. For the duration, the weapon is considered magical for the purpose of overcoming Immunity and Resistance to nonmagical attacks.</p><p>For each additional 2 sorcery points you spend, you can give the weapon a +1 bonus to Attack Rolls and damage rolls (up to +3), stacking with existing bonuses on the weapon, up to a maximum of +5 for the Attack Roll bonus.</p>",
